~ start
Cyrus Rowe: Hm? 
Cyrus Rowe: Guards have gone through here. They seem to have been rampaging through their belongings for something. Assuming from the blood in the area, someone got hurt. 
Cyrus Rowe: What kind of thug did they come across that was able to wound them? The others should be located elsewhere right now for a different mission. 
Cyrus Rowe: ... Hm? These fools haven’t even used some of these! 
Cyrus Rowe: Now, how could I ever leave something so useful just laying around like that? It would be such a huge waste~.
do Campaign.give_item("cyrus", "cure_potion")
do Campaign.give_item("cyrus", "medicine")
do Campaign.give_item("cyrus", "bomb")
do Campaign.give_item("cyrus", "poison_bottle")
=> END